Tool response:
Tool: find_available_accommodations
Description: Search for accommodations that match the criteria: 
- Type is Cabin or Yurt
- 2 bedrooms
- Has air conditioning
- Has kitchenette
- Max occupancy >= guests
- Available for the given date range (no overlapping confirmed/pending bookings)

Returns the nightly rate for each matching accommodation.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "check_in_date": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Check-in date in YYYY-MM-DD format",
          "title": "Check In Date"
        },
        "check_out_date": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Check-out date in YYYY-MM-DD format",
          "title": "Check Out Date"
        },
        "guests": {
          "type": "integer",
          "description": "Number of guests",
          "title": "Guests"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "check_in_date",
        "check_out_date",
        "guests"
      ]
    }
